## Tech Stack (Sab Free Tier)

- Frontend: React (Vite) + Tailwind → deploy on Vercel
- Backend: Node/Express + Socket.io → deploy on Render (free web service)
- DB: MongoDB Atlas free cluster
- File storage: Cloudinary free tier
- Email: Ethereal (fake SMTP, no real sending needed) ya Resend free tier
- Drag-drop: `@dnd-kit/core` ya `react-beautiful-dnd`


